earch.\n\n## FAQs\n\nWhat does Harsh Group specialise in? [...] ## 4 BHK Flats in Mumbai\n\nOffers ample space and high-end features for larger families or those desiring a luxurious lifestyle.\n\n## 5 BHK Flats in Mumbai\n\nThe epitome of luxury, providing expansive living areas and premium amenities.\n\n…\n\n## Exceptional Projects: Luxury Residences in Mumbai\n\nOur commitment to quality is evident in all the residential projects in Mumbai we undertake. We ensure that each development includes the following:\n\n## Luxurious Amenities\n\nEnjoy features like state-of-the-art fitness centers, swimming pools, and landscaped gardens.\n\n## Modern Architecture\n\nOur properties showcase innovative design and architecture that enhance your living experience.\n\n## High-Quality Construction\n\nWe use the best materials and adhere to the highest standards of construction.","score":0.8634900344618388,"raw_content":null,"id":"56305f-03"},{"url":"https://www.sulekha.com/sri-harsh-developers-andheri-mumbai-contact-address","title":"Sri Harsh Developers in Andheri, Mumbai - Sulekha","content":"Web Design and Development. Personal Service. Loans · Visa Consultants · Beauty Parlour Services · Event Organisers · Catering Services · Photographers &","score":0.8612050870099703,"raw_content":null,"id":"45ec3c-04"},{"url":"https://www.zaubacorp.com/company/SRI-HARSH-SPACES-PRIVATE-LIMITED/U70103MH2018PTC305174","title":"SRI HARSH SPACES PRIVATE LIMITED | ZaubaCorp","content":"SRI HARSH SPACES PRIVATE LIMITED (CIN: U70103MH2018PTC305174) is a Private company incorporated on 17 Feb 2018. It is classified as Non-government company","score":0.8585929741185582,"raw_content":null,"id":"7f1471-05"},{"url":"https://harshgroup.co.in/new-residential-projects-mumbai","title":"New Residential Projects in Mumbai 2026: What Buyers Actually Need to Know Harsh Group","content":"Carpet area, built-up area, and super built-up area are three different numbers, and only one of them tells you how much floor space you’ll actually live in. A higher carpet-to-built-up ratio means a more usable home for the same price. Always compare projects on carpet area, not the headline figure.\n\n### 7. Visit the site\n\nConstruction quality isn’t visible in a brochure. The finish of floors, the quality of fixtures, and how the ventilation actually works are the things that determine how a home ages and how much it costs to maintain over the years. An hour on-site is worth more than a dozen glossy renders.\n\n### 8. Research what’s coming nearby [...] Explore Harsh Group’s new residential projects in Mumbai’s most sought-after locations.\n\nSchedule a Site Visit\n\n## A] Why 2026 Is a Strong Year for Real Estate Investment in Mumbai\n\nMumbai’s infrastructure story in 2026 is one of the strongest arguments for investing now. Metro Lines 2A, 7, and 11 have materially changed how people move across the city. The Coastal Road has cut travel times between South Mumbai and the western suburbs. These aren’t future promises, they’re present realities, and they’re already pushing demand upward in well-connected central locations. [...] Harsh Aurum, Dadar West, sits at 291, Swatantryaveer Savarkar Road, right in the Shivaji Park neighbourhood. It’s a 67,500 sq. ft. development offering 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments. The amenities include a rooftop Lounge, a gymnasium, a yoga deck, EV charging, and parking. It’s Vastu-compliant and positioned in a micro-market where new supply is genuinely limited.\n Harsh Crown, in Dadar West, takes a different approach entirely. Located at 15/F, Dr Madhukar Rout Road near Shivaji Park, it’s a premium offering with spacious 5 BHK residences. This one is for buyers who want privacy, scale, and a central address without compromise. There aren’t many projects in this category in Shivaji Park, which is precisely the point.","score":0.8542759956262183,"raw_content":null,"id":"768759-06"},{"url":"https://lotusdevelopers.com","title":"Mumbai’s premier Real Estate Developers - Lotus Developers","content":"Lotus Grandeur\n\nLocation: Andheri| Status: Completed\n\nA commercial hub for the Indian film fraternity, Located in Andheri, Grandeur boasts massive floorplates and ultimate planning flexibility. Equipped with common amenities to cater to business productivity, Grandeur offers a self sufficient ecosystem to its patrons.\n\n\n\nLotus Corporate Park\n\nLocation: Jogeshwari East| Status: Completed\n\nLCP is one of the largest commercial parks in Mumbai. It is an amalgamation of the finest amenities complementing large flexible office spaces. LCP houses the head offices of many Fortune 500 multinationals and corporate powerhouses.\n\nContact Us\n\nName:  Sri Lotus Developers and Realty Limited (Formerly known as \"AKP Holdings Limited\" & \"AKP Holdings Private Limited\") [...] Lotus attention to detail is apparent from our ability to customise amenities as is reflected our projects Ananya and Ayana which come with rooftop amenities such as swimming pool, cabanas and sit outs space for our audience, while Signature to include amenities such as private theatre, banquet, private lounge, etc. in addition to standard amenities of an office building. [...] Registered Office:  5th & 6th Floor, Lotus Tower, 1 Jai Hind Society, N. S. Road No. 12/A, JVPD Scheme, Juhu, Mumbai 400049, Maharashtra, India\n\nCIN:  L68200MH2015PLC262020\n\nEmail:  info@lotusdevelopers.com\n\nContact Person: Mr. Ankit Tater, Company Secretary & Compliance Officer\n\nPhone:  +91 7506283400\n\nEmail:  compliance@lotusdevelopers.com\n\nSri Lotus Developers and Realty Limited (Formerly known as \"AKP Holdings Limited\") is proposing, subject to applicable statutory and regulatory requirements, receipt of requisite approvals, market conditions and other considerations, to make an initial public offering of its Equity Shares and has filed the DRHP with SEBI\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nCopyright © 2026 Lotus Developers.\n\n### DISCLAIMER","score":0.8512571778759436,"raw_content":null,"id":"26832a-07"}],"response_time":5.06,"request_id":"0d1cb1b1-c98f-4d1e-8452-9ba46ef4cf8d"}